## What this targets

The open question on `quadratic-reciprocity-algorithm` asks for a *permutation-sign*
proof of quadratic reciprocity organised around **Zolotarev's lemma**: for an odd prime
`p` and `a` coprime to `p`,

  (a / p) = sign(π_a),    π_a : x ↦ a · x   a permutation of (ℤ/p)ˣ.

The genuinely-new building block S9 isolated (and which is **absent from Mathlib** at the
